      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200701701/2007017010020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "トラブルがあった時の定石だよな\r\n──結華の荷物、こっち置いていいか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007017010030,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "うんありがとう！\r\n……誠実な対応って大事だもんねぇ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701701/2007017010030"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007017010040,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "っていうか普通に三峰が使わせてもらうことになってるけど\r\nＰたんがこの部屋じゃなくていいの？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701701/2007017010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺じゃせっかくのいい部屋でも持て余しちゃうからなぁ\r\n結華に使ってもらえると嬉しいよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007017010050,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あは、じゃあ遠慮なく～",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701701/2007017010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おう。中、確認だけさせてもらうな\r\n終わったら出るから",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
